# Local run evidence: validate.sh / swift-parse-check.sh status output, release
# smoke logs, xcodebuild test logs, per-PR review logs. None of it is ever
# edited after it is written, so it does not belong in git history. Attach
# validation evidence to the issue/PR or upload it as a CI artifact instead
# (#923).
artifacts/
.migrate.log
